EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Hold up, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Man, I work out all the time, and I
can barely keep up with you!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Non correre così tanto, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Mi alleno tutti i giorni, ma non
riesco a starti dietro!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Dur bakalım, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Dostum, sürekli antrenman yapıyorum
ama sana zar zor yetişiyorum!

EN:
Sheesh! Is it really that big a deal?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Is there something I should know?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
I'll slow down a little...
Trying to ditch you...

ES:
¡Pero bueno! ¿Tanta prisa hay?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Qué me estás ocultando?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Vale, frenaré un poco...
Intento dejarte tirado...

TRANSLATION:
Yahu! Gerçekten bu kadar önemli mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bilmem gereken bir şey mi var?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Biraz yavaşlayacağım...
Seni atlatmaya çalışıyorum...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Grawwrr!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You think you're so cool
just because you're faster than me,
don't you?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Well, you're bruising my ego muscle!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Should we call this off or what?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
No, let's go!
Yeah, we're done.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Was zur Hantel soll das?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Denkst du,
du bist cool,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bloß weil du mich mal
abhängen konntest?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Das ist echt ein grobes Foulspiel!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Willst du, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}dass wir's sein lassen?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Nein, gehen wir!
Genau! Lassen wir's.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Graaavr!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sırf benden hızlısın diye
kendini çok havalı sanıyorsun, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ego
kasımı incitiyorsun!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bunu iptal mi edelim, ne yapalım?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Hayır, gidelim!
Evet, bitti.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Da wollten wir nicht hin!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Oder{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
hast du plötzlich doch irgendwas
anderes zu tun?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Nein! Gehn wir weiter!
Ja, das stimmt...

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Warte, warte, warte!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Wo zur Hantel gehst du hin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Willst du mich loswerden?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hast du plötzlich doch
irgendwas anderes zu tun?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Nein, nein. Weiter geht's!
Ja, das stimmt...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Dur! Dur! Dur!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Niye o tarafa
gidiyorsun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Beni ekmeye mi çalışıyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Başka bir işin mi var?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Benim hatam. Hadi gidelim!
Bir şey çıktı...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Quanto ci vuole ancora?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
La mia resistenza sta per finire!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Scusa, ma me ne vado a casa.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Ho fatto già abbastanza esercizio
per oggi, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Wie lange soll das denn noch gehen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Sogar ein Marathon-Champ wie ich
muss da irgendwann aufgeben!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Tut mir leid! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Das war's für heute!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich hatte genug Lauftraining für
einen Tag, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Non è possibile!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci stiamo mettendo troppo tempo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Scusa, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, ma devo
lasciarti perdere{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} perché ho
delle altre cose da fare.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} non se la prenderà.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Prima o poi risolveremo
la questione{{TAG:0003:0001:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Wow!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das dauert mir jetzt echt zu lang!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tut mir leid, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aber ich muss jetzt gehen.
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich hab noch was zu erledigen.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} wird's sicher überleben!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vielleicht können wir diese Sache ja
ein andermal klären!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I know you want to get there right
away,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} but I'm not really conditioned
for this speed right now{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sé que quieres llegar allí ahora
mismo,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} pero es que tengo agujetas
y me estás destrozando{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ho capito che vuoi arrivare il prima
possibile,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ma non ho voglia
di correre così veloce ora{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi viene da ridere,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Pensavo di essere
io quello sbadato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} benimle konuşmak istiyor, ha?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tamam!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Bana uyar!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ama artık koca adamım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bunu kendi başıma halledebilirim bence,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hem senin ağırlaman gereken
arkadaşların yok mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Git
onlarla ilgilen!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} demande à me voir ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Mais dis-moi, tu attends quelqu'un,
non ?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Alors occupe-t'en et ne
